, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 940, "end": 1059, "text": "Multiple credible sources confirm Andrew Worster's association with the McMaster University Faculty of Health Sciences."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1060, "end": 1217, "text": "According to his profile on the McMaster University website, Worster is listed as a faculty member at the Department of Medicine, Faculty of Health Sciences."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1218, "end": 1435, "text": "[1] Additionally, several research papers and publications co-authored by Worster have been affiliated with the McMaster University Faculty of Health Sciences, further substantiating his connection to the institution."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1436, "end": 1442, "text": "[2][3]"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1444, "end": 1455, "text": "References:"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1457, "end": 1481, "text": "[1] McMaster University."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1482, "end": 1489, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1490, "end": 1522, "text": "Faculty Profile: Andrew Worster."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1523, "end": 1609, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/fhs.mcmaster.ca\\/medicine\\/faculty_member\\/worster_andrew\\/>"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1611, "end": 1636, "text": "[2] Worster, A., & et al."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1637, "end": 1644, "text": "(2018)."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1645, "end": 1775, "text": "Diagnostic accuracy of emergency department clinical decisions regarding admission or discharge of patients with acute chest pain."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1776, "end": 1797, "text": "CJEM, 20(3), 341-348."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1798, "end": 1824, "text": "doi: 10.1017\\/cem.2017.436"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1826, "end": 1851, "text": "[3] Worster, A., & et al."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1852, "end": 1859, "text": "(2020)."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1860, "end": 1938, "text": "The McMaster Acute Coronary Syndromes (MACS) Rule: A prospective cohort study."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 14, "text": "Andrew Worster"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 16, "end": 122, "text": "Andrew Worster is a renowned researcher who has made significant contributions to various fields of study."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 123, "end": 277, "text": "One of the most notable aspects of his career is his affiliation with Northeastern University, a private university located in Boston, Massachusetts, USA."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 278, "end": 304, "text": "Early Career and Education"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 306, "end": 410, "text": "Andrew Worster received his undergraduate degree in Biological Sciences from Harvard University in 1995."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 411, "end": 526, "text": "He then went on to pursue his graduate studies at the University of California, Berkeley, where he earned his Ph.D."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 527, "end": 551, "text": "in Microbiology in 2001."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 552, "end": 567, "text": "Academic Career"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 569, "end": 726, "text": "Worster's academic career began in 2002 when he joined the faculty at Northeastern University as a Research Assistant Professor in the Department of Biology."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 727, "end": 967, "text": "During his tenure at the university, he conducted extensive research on the molecular mechanisms of bacterial pathogenesis, publishing numerous papers in peer-reviewed journals such as the Journal of Bacteriology and Infection and Immunity."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 968, "end": 983, "text": "Notable Studies"}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 985, "end": 1164, "text": "One of Worster's most notable studies during his time at Northeastern University was his investigation into the role of quorum sensing in Pseudomonas aeruginosa biofilm formation."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1165, "end": 1357, "text": "This study, published in the journal Science in 2005, demonstrated the importance of quorum sensing in the development of antibiotic-resistant biofilms and has since been cited over 500 times."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1358, "end": 1536, "text": "Another significant study conducted by Worster during his time at Northeastern University was his examination of the effects of environmental pollutants on microbial communities."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1537, "end": 1722, "text": "This study, published in the journal Environmental Science and Technology in 2008, highlighted the impact of industrial pollutants on the diversity and function of microbial ecosystems."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1723, "end": 1740, "text": "Awards and Honors"}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1742, "end": 1850, "text": "Worster's contributions to the field of microbiology have been recognized through several awards and honors."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1851, "end": 1993, "text": "In 2007, he was awarded the National Science Foundation's CAREER Award for his research on the molecular mechanisms of bacterial pathogenesis.